OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers' support scheme watered
OL,4,Adown - councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scheme to help Worcestershire farmers
OL,7,Fby getting more locally-grown produce
OL,8,Finto schools was watered down before
OL,9,Fbeing approved, a councillor has
OL,10,Fclaimed.
OL,12,FReform councillor Justin Bowen said the
OL,13,Fmotion passed by Worcestershire County
OL,14,FCouncil on Thursday was not what he had
OL,15,Foriginally put forward.
OL,17,FBowen had called for "food sourced from
OL,18,Flocal farmers" to be served in schools
OL,19,Fby caterers commissioned by the council
OL,20,Fwherever possible, working within
OL,21,Fexisting procurement practices.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
