OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers' support scheme watered
OL,4,Adown - councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Tory councillor Emma Kearsey said
OL,7,Fthe motion was "extremely idealistic",
OL,8,Fwith Labour's Richard Udall saying it
OL,9,Fhad "warm words", but would not have
OL,10,Fmuch impact, adding Brexit had been
OL,11,Fagriculture's biggest killer.
